<view class="page-shell"><view class="shop-header"><text class="page-title">精选商城</text><text class="page-subtitle">只选操作简单、信息清楚的日常好物。</text></view><scroll-view class="category-scroll" scroll-x show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="category-row"><button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="category-item {{selectedCategory === item ? 'category-active' : ''}}" data-category="{{item}}" bindtap="selectCategory">{{item}}</button></view></scroll-view><view class="product-list"><button wx:for="{{visibleProducts}}" wx:key="id" class="product-item" bindtap="showProduct"><view class="product-art"><text>{{item.category}}</text></view><view class="product-main"><text class="product-tag">{{item.tag}}</text><text class="product-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="product-price">¥{{item.price}}</text></view></button></view><text class="shop-note">框架阶段不提供购买和支付，接入正式供应链后再开放。</text></view>
